From 24c415a311d184a89c588b633e7cc533a8968d39 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OneFeiFan <3022504358@qq.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 01:13:41 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] gki_defconfig: enable the CRIU diag families and FHANDLE

Enable UNIX_DIAG, PACKET_DIAG and NETLINK_DIAG so CRIU/docker
checkpoint can collect socket state, and FHANDLE so systemd can be used
as a container init.

FHANDLE selects EXPORTFS. Do not give containers CAP_DAC_READ_SEARCH:
file handles are only meaningful inside the container's own mount
namespace.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Code <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig | 4 ++++
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
index d7a15d148..81fd17f00 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
+++ b/arch/arm64/configs/gki_defconfig
@@ -860,6 +860,10 @@ CONFIG_CFS_BANDWIDTH=y
 CONFIG_BLK_DEV_THROTTLING=y
 CONFIG_NET_CLS_CGROUP=y
 CONFIG_CHECKPOINT_RESTORE=y
+CONFIG_UNIX_DIAG=y
+CONFIG_PACKET_DIAG=y
+CONFIG_NETLINK_DIAG=y
+CONFIG_FHANDLE=y
 CONFIG_BTRFS_FS=y
 CONFIG_BTRFS_FS_POSIX_ACL=y
 
